{"seq":1,"slug":"face-recognition","title":"人脸识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/cv-applications/face-recognition","wordCount":1354,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"人脸识别\">人脸识别</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>人脸识别是计算机视觉中商业化程度最高的应用之一，其核心目标是通过人脸图像确认或识别个体身份。完整的人脸识别系统包含人脸检测、人脸对齐、特征提取和特征比对四个主要环节。每个环节都有对应的技术挑战和解决方案。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[输入图像] --&gt; B[人脸检测]&#10;    B --&gt; C[关键点定位]&#10;    C --&gt; D[人脸对齐]&#10;    D --&gt; E[特征提取]&#10;    E --&gt; F{应用场景}&#10;    F --&gt; G[1:1 验证]&#10;    F --&gt; H[1:N 识别]&#10;    F --&gt; I[聚类分组]\">graph LR\n    A[输入图像] --&gt; B[人脸检测]\n    B --&gt; C[关键点定位]\n    C --&gt; D[人脸对齐]\n    D --&gt; E[特征提取]\n    E --&gt; F{应用场景}\n    F --&gt; G[1:1 验证]\n    F --&gt; H[1:N 识别]\n    F --&gt; I[聚类分组]</pre><p>人脸识别的技术难点包括：光照变化（同一人在不同光照下外观差异大）、姿态变化（正面与侧面差异）、年龄变化（跨年龄识别）、遮挡（口罩、墨镜）和欺骗攻击（打印照片、视频回放）。这些挑战驱动了人脸识别技术的不断演进。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>流水线环节</th>\n<th>核心任务</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n<th>关键指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人脸检测</td>\n<td>定位人脸位置</td>\n<td>RetinaFace, SCRFD</td>\n<td>召回率、速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键点定位</td>\n<td>定位眼、鼻、嘴等</td>\n<td>PFLD, ADNet</td>\n<td>关键点误差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人脸对齐</td>\n<td>仿射变换标准化</td>\n<td>5 点对齐</td>\n<td>对齐精度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征提取</td>\n<td>生成人脸嵌入</td>\n<td>ArcFace, AdaFace</td>\n<td>LFW、CFP-FP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征比对</td>\n<td>余弦相似度比较</td>\n<td>阈值决策</td>\n<td>FAR、FRR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>活体检测</td>\n<td>防止欺骗攻击</td>\n<td>深度检测、纹理分析</td>\n<td>ACER</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"人脸检测与对齐\">人脸检测与对齐</h2><p>人脸检测是识别流水线的第一步。现代人脸检测器需要在复杂场景中快速准确地定位所有人脸，包括小脸、遮挡脸和多角度脸。RetinaFace 在单阶段检测器的基础上同时预测人脸框、五个关键点和 3D 人脸网格，实现了像素级精度的人脸定位。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import cv2&#10;import numpy as np&#10;from insightface.app import FaceAnalysis&#10;&#10;app = FaceAnalysis(providers=[&#39;CUDAExecutionProvider&#39;])&#10;app.prepare(ctx_id=0, det_size=(640, 640))&#10;&#10;img = cv2.imread(&quot;group_photo.jpg&quot;)&#10;faces = app.get(img)&#10;&#10;for face in faces:&#10;    bbox = face.bbox.astype(int)&#10;    landmarks = face.landmark_2d_106&#10;    embedding = face.embedding&#10;    print(f&quot;人脸框: {bbox}, 嵌入维度: {embedding.shape}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> insightface.app </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FaceAnalysis</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FaceAnalysis(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">providers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CUDAExecutionProvider'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.prepare(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">det_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">640</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">640</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">img </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.imread(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"group_photo.jpg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">faces </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app.get(img)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> face </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> faces:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bbox </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> face.bbox.astype(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    landmarks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> face.landmark_2d_106</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    embedding </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> face.embedding</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"人脸框: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bbox</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, 嵌入维度: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">embedding.shape</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>人脸对齐通过仿射变换将检测到的人脸标准化到统一的坐标空间。最常用的方法是基于五点对齐：利用两只眼睛、鼻尖和两个嘴角的五个关键点，计算到标准模板的仿射变换矩阵，然后将人脸图像变换到 112×112 的标准尺寸。对齐操作消除了平移、旋转和缩放的影响，使后续的特征提取更加稳定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 人脸对齐流程&#10;        A[检测人脸框] --&gt; B[定位 5 个关键点]&#10;        B --&gt; C[计算仿射矩阵]&#10;        C --&gt; D[变换到标准坐标]&#10;        D --&gt; E[112x112 对齐脸]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 人脸对齐流程\n        A[检测人脸框] --&gt; B[定位 5 个关键点]\n        B --&gt; C[计算仿射矩阵]\n        C --&gt; D[变换到标准坐标]\n        D --&gt; E[112x112 对齐脸]\n    end</pre><p>SCRFD 是当前速度最快的高精度人脸检测器之一，它在 SCRFD-500M 配置下仅需 0.5 GFLOPs 即可在 WiderFace 上达到 90%+ 的 AP，非常适合移动端和边缘设备部署。</p>\n<h2 id=\"arcface-与度量学习损失\">ArcFace 与度量学习损失</h2><p>ArcFace（Additive Angular Margin Loss）是当前最主流的人脸识别损失函数。它在 Softmax 分类损失的基础上添加了角度间隔（angular margin），使得同一人的特征更加聚集，不同人的特征更加分散。</p>\n<p>传统 Softmax 损失鼓励模型将特征分到正确类别，但不关心特征的紧凑度和类间分离度。ArcFace 在特征向量和权重向量的夹角 θ 上添加一个常数间隔 m，等效于要求同类特征不仅要正确分类，还要与类中心保持足够小的角度距离。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;import torch.nn.functional as F&#10;import math&#10;&#10;class ArcFace(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, in_features, out_features, s=64.0, m=0.5):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.weight = nn.Parameter(torch.FloatTensor(out_features, in_features))&#10;        nn.init.xavier_uniform_(self.weight)&#10;        self.s = s&#10;        self.m = m&#10;        self.cos_m = math.cos(m)&#10;        self.sin_m = math.sin(m)&#10;        self.th = math.cos(math.pi - m)&#10;        self.mm = math.sin(math.pi - m) * m&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, input, label):&#10;        cosine = F.linear(F.normalize(input), F.normalize(self.weight))&#10;        sine = torch.sqrt(1.0 - torch.pow(cosine, 2))&#10;        phi = cosine * self.cos_m - sine * self.sin_m&#10;        phi = torch.where(cosine &gt; self.th, phi, cosine - self.mm)&#10;        one_hot = torch.zeros_like(cosine)&#10;        one_hot.scatter_(1, label.view(-1, 1), 1)&#10;        output = (one_hot * phi) + ((1.0 - one_hot) * cosine)&#10;        output *= self.s&#10;        return output\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.functional </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> math</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ArcFace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, in_features, out_features, s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.weight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Parameter(torch.FloatTensor(out_features, in_features))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        nn.init.xavier_uniform_(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.weight)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.cos_m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> math.cos(m)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.sin_m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> math.sin(m)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.th </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> math.cos(math.pi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> math.sin(math.pi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, input, label):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        cosine </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.linear(F.normalize(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">input</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), F.normalize(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.weight))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sine </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.sqrt(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.pow(cosine, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        phi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cosine </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.cos_m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sine </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.sin_m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        phi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.where(cosine </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.th, phi, cosine </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mm)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        one_hot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.zeros_like(cosine)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        one_hot.scatter_(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, label.view(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        output </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (one_hot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> phi) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> one_hot) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cosine)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        output </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> output</span></span></code></pre></div><p>AdaFace 在 ArcFace 基础上引入了自适应间隔：根据图像质量动态调整间隔大小。高质量（清晰、正面）的样本使用更大的间隔以提升判别性，低质量（模糊、侧面）的样本使用更小的间隔避免过度惩罚。这种设计在非约束场景（如监控摄像头）中效果显著。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>损失函数</th>\n<th>间隔类型</th>\n<th>LFW 精度</th>\n<th>CFP-FP 精度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Softmax</td>\n<td>无间隔</td>\n<td>99.0%</td>\n<td>92.5%</td>\n<td>基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CosFace</td>\n<td>余弦间隔</td>\n<td>99.7%</td>\n<td>96.8%</td>\n<td>简单有效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ArcFace</td>\n<td>角度间隔</td>\n<td>99.8%</td>\n<td>98.3%</td>\n<td>最主流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AdaFace</td>\n<td>自适应间隔</td>\n<td>99.8%</td>\n<td>98.5%</td>\n<td>质量感知</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"活体检测与安全机制\">活体检测与安全机制</h2><p>活体检测（Liveness Detection / Face Anti-Spoofing）是人脸识别系统的安全屏障。没有活体检测的人脸识别系统极易被照片、视频或 3D 面具欺骗。活体检测的目标是区分真人和各种类型的欺骗攻击。</p>\n<p>活体检测方法分为硬件方案和软件方案。硬件方案使用红外摄像头、结构光或飞行时间（ToF）传感器捕获深度信息，天然能够区分平面照片和立体人脸。软件方案仅使用普通 RGB 摄像头，通过分析纹理特征、光照一致性、运动模式等线索来判断真伪。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class FASModel(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, backbone):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.backbone = backbone&#10;        self.binary_head = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Linear(512, 128),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Linear(128, 2),&#10;        )&#10;        self.depth_head = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.ConvTranspose2d(512, 256, 4, 2, 1),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.ConvTranspose2d(256, 1, 4, 2, 1),&#10;            nn.Sigmoid(),&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        features = self.backbone(x)&#10;        binary = self.binary_head(features.mean(dim=(-2, -1)))&#10;        depth = self.depth_head(features)&#10;        return binary, depth\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FASModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, backbone):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.backbone </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> backbone</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.binary_head </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.depth_head </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ConvTranspose2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ConvTranspose2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Sigmoid(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.backbone(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        binary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.binary_head(features.mean(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        depth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.depth_head(features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> binary, depth</span></span></code></pre></div><p>多模态活体检测结合 RGB、近红外（NIR）和深度三种模态，在各种攻击手段下都能保持高准确率。CASIA-SURF 数据集提供了多模态活体检测的标准基准。在实际部署中，通常结合交互式检测（如要求用户眨眼、转头、张嘴）和被动式检测（静默分析图像特征）来构建多层防御机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((人脸识别))&#10;    检测与对齐&#10;      RetinaFace&#10;      SCRFD&#10;      五点对齐&#10;    特征提取&#10;      ArcFace&#10;      AdaFace&#10;      度量学习&#10;    安全机制&#10;      活体检测&#10;      多模态防伪&#10;      交互式验证\">mindmap\n  root((人脸识别))\n    检测与对齐\n      RetinaFace\n      SCRFD\n      五点对齐\n    特征提取\n      ArcFace\n      AdaFace\n      度量学习\n    安全机制\n      活体检测\n      多模态防伪\n      交互式验证</pre><ul>\n<li>人脸识别流水线包含检测、对齐、特征提取和比对四个环节，每个环节的质量都影响最终性能</li>\n<li>ArcFace 通过角度间隔损失实现了高区分性的人脸特征学习，是当前最主流的方案</li>\n<li>AdaFace 通过自适应间隔在非约束场景中进一步提升了性能</li>\n<li>活体检测是人脸识别系统的安全必备组件，多模态方案最为可靠</li>\n<li>InsightFace 提供了从检测到识别的完整开源工具链</li>\n<li>人脸识别涉及隐私和伦理问题，部署时必须遵守相关法律法规</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"人脸识别","id":"人脸识别"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"人脸检测与对齐","id":"人脸检测与对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"ArcFace 与度量学习损失","id":"arcface-与度量学习损失"},{"level":2,"text":"活体检测与安全机制","id":"活体检测与安全机制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"点云处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/video-and-3d/point-cloud-processing"},"next":{"title":"OCR 与文档处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/cv-applications/ocr-document"}}